DELETE /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/ai-search/instances/{id}
Permanently delete an AI Search instance and all its indexed data. Deprecated: use /accounts/{account_id}/ai-search/namespaces/{name}/instances (and descendant paths) instead.
Required: account_id (path); id (path)

DELETE /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/ai-search/namespaces/{name}
Permanently delete a namespace. The namespace must be empty (no instances), and the default namespace cannot be deleted.
Required: account_id (path); name (path)

DELETE /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/ai-search/tokens/{id}
Permanently delete a stored AI Search credential. Credentials in use by an instance cannot be deleted.
Required: account_id (path); id (path)

GET /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/ai-search/instances/{id}
Retrieve the configuration and status of an AI Search instance. Deprecated: use /accounts/{account_id}/ai-search/namespaces/{name}/instances (and descendant paths) instead.
Required: account_id (path); id (path)

GET /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/ai-search/namespaces/{name}
Retrieve a namespace and its description.
Required: account_id (path); name (path)

GET /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/ai-search/tokens/{id}
Retrieve a stored AI Search credential without exposing its secret.
Required: account_id (path); id (path)

GET /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/ai-search/instances/{id}/jobs/{job_id}
Retrieves details for a specific AI Search indexing job. Deprecated: use /accounts/{account_id}/ai-search/namespaces/{name}/instances (and descendant paths) instead.
Required: id (path) — AI Search instance ID. Lowercase alphanumeric, hyphens, and underscores.; job_id (path); account_id (path)

DELETE /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/ai-search/namespaces/{name}/instances/{id}
Permanently delete an AI Search instance and all its indexed data.
Required: account_id (path); id (path); name (path) — Namespace name

GET /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/ai-search/namespaces/{name}/instances/{id}
Retrieve the configuration and status of an AI Search instance.
Required: account_id (path); id (path); name (path) — Namespace name

DELETE /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/ai-search/namespaces/{name}/instances/{id}/items/{item_id}
Deletes a file from a managed AI Search instance and triggers a reindex.
Required: id (path) — AI Search instance ID. Lowercase alphanumeric, hyphens, and underscores.; item_id (path); account_id (path); name (path) — Namespace name

GET /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/ai-search/namespaces/{name}/instances/{id}/items/{item_id}
Retrieves a specific indexed item from an AI Search instance.
Required: id (path) — AI Search instance ID. Lowercase alphanumeric, hyphens, and underscores.; item_id (path); account_id (path); name (path) — Namespace name

GET /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/ai-search/namespaces/{name}/instances/{id}/jobs/{job_id}
Retrieves details for a specific AI Search indexing job.
Required: id (path) — AI Search instance ID. Lowercase alphanumeric, hyphens, and underscores.; job_id (path); account_id (path); name (path) — Namespace name
